#. Config error; `fastMode` is the config file's own field name
#: src/config.ts
msgid "{path}.fastMode must be a boolean"
msgstr "{path}.fastMode must be a boolean"

#. Config error; `permissions` is the config file's own field name
#: src/config.ts
msgid "{path}.permissions must be an object"
msgstr "{path}.permissions must be an object"

#. Config error; the policy's name and `allow`/`ask`/`deny` are the config file's own words
#: src/config.ts
msgid "{path}.permissions.{policy} must be allow, ask, or deny"
msgstr "{path}.permissions.{policy} must be allow, ask, or deny"

#. Config error; `permissions.mode`, `auto` and `bypass` are the config file's own words
#: src/config.ts
